<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Negara Properties year net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Negara Properties year net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  52.60   vs	  34.96</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 89.0    vs	  59.0</p>
